    "Storage volumes are accounted in bytes in a real ledger; only the purge test materialises a file on disk. Nothing gigabytes-sized is written.",
    "The 27B coding worker and Bojo planner were not started; their lanes are exercised by the unit tests and the existing kernel bench, not here.",
